:question
$()$val7:	<div class="wimscenter">	
!insmath  v_1 = ($val11,$val15,$val19) 
$(),	 
!insmath v_2 = ($val12,$val16,$val20) 
$(),	 
!insmath v_3 = ($val13,$val17,$val21) 
$(),	 
